# Dart / Flutter

- Prefer collection `if`/`for`, `??` / `??=`, tear-offs.
- No new helpers/wrappers unless they remove real duplication.
- Dashboard: follow existing `AppTheme`, screen/widget patterns; avoid one-off card systems.
- Server: keep routes thin; stores own SQL; runners stay side-effect focused.
- Tests: put next to feature under `test/`; run focused files before full suite.

Health-check scripts pasted into the dashboard are **standalone** (`dart:io` / `dart:convert` only — no package imports).
